**IMPORTANT — MIMIC-IV DATA USE AGREEMENT**

This repository does **not** distribute any MIMIC-IV data. All MIMIC-IV data
files (``data/``, ``*.csv``, ``*.joblib``, model weights) are excluded via
``.gitignore``. Researchers wishing to reproduce this work must obtain
independent access to MIMIC-IV via PhysioNet:

  https://physionet.org/content/mimiciv/

and comply with the PhysioNet Credentialed Health Data Use Agreement. Use of
MIMIC-IV is subject to an IRB-approved research protocol. The code in this
repository processes de-identified data only; no protected health information
(PHI) is present in the git history.
